WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:04.000
-Prominent Republicans,
including Donald Trump,

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.767
gathered for the annual
Conservative Political Action

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:07.167
Conference
over the weekend,

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:10.133
where speakers like Don Jr.,
Mike Lindell and Nikki Haley

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:13.167
were greeted by the embarrassing
spectacle of half empty rooms

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:14.467
while they ranted
about the usual

00:00:14.467 --> 00:00:16.567
conspiracy theories
and culture war nonsense.

00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:19.267
But there was one
major Republican politician

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:20.601
who wasn't in attendance.

00:00:20.601 --> 00:00:23.167
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look.

00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:24.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:26.868
♪♪

00:00:26.868 --> 00:00:29.601
There is, of course,
one name looming over

00:00:29.601 --> 00:00:31.367
all of Republican politics
right now,

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:33.601
and that's Ron DeSantis,
the Florida governor

00:00:33.601 --> 00:00:36.267
who's expected to launch
his 2024 bid soon.

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:37.934
Now, DeSantis'
main focus as governor

00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:39.400
has been using the power
of the government

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:40.934
to fight so-called wokeism,

00:00:40.934 --> 00:00:43.801
which as far as I can tell,
he can't even define.

00:00:43.801 --> 00:00:47.000
It just seems to mean anything
that's bothering conservatives

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.334
and wealthy old comedians.

00:00:48.334 --> 00:00:51.334
It's basically just
a collection of petty grievances

00:00:51.334 --> 00:00:53.067
about meaningless
culture war issues

00:00:53.067 --> 00:00:54.968
like gender neutral
Potato Head dolls

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:58.968
or M&amp;Ms not wearing
sexy clothes anymore,

00:00:58.968 --> 00:01:02.400
a thing they on purpose
say out loud all the time.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:04.234
If you accidentally said
you thought

00:01:04.234 --> 00:01:06.133
the green M&amp;M was hot
in fourth grade,

00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:09.367
you'd be teased about it
until you graduated high school.

00:01:09.367 --> 00:01:11.267
"Oh, don't open
those around Ronnie,

00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:13.167
or else he's going to melt
in his pants."

00:01:13.167 --> 00:01:14.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.601 --> 00:01:17.167
If Republicans win
at all in 2024,

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:19.334
I'm sure their first act
right out of the gate

00:01:19.334 --> 00:01:21.868
will be a law requiring
the green M&amp;M to wear full

00:01:21.868 --> 00:01:23.834
BDSM gear.

00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:26.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.467 --> 00:01:30.834
[Bleep]

00:01:30.834 --> 00:01:32.534
It kind of worked on me.

00:01:32.534 --> 00:01:35.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:38.200
DeSantis chose to skip the
Conservative Political Action

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.400
Conference and give a speech
at the Ronald Reagan Library

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.000
over the weekend
where he once again

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.434
complained about Wokeism.

00:01:43.434 --> 00:01:46.801
-I think these liberal states
have gotten it wrong.

00:01:46.801 --> 00:01:48.868
And why are they
getting it wrong?

00:01:48.868 --> 00:01:52.033
I think it all goes
back to ideology.

00:01:52.033 --> 00:01:54.434
I think it goes back
to this woke mind virus

00:01:54.434 --> 00:01:58.601
that's infected the left and
all these other institutions.

00:01:58.601 --> 00:02:02.033
-What the hell
is the woke mind virus?

00:02:02.033 --> 00:02:05.067
They should add a Ron DeSantis
character to "The Last of Us,"

00:02:05.067 --> 00:02:07.300
who's always focused
on the wrong thing.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.400
"That goddamn virus
turned my whole family

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:10.701
into mushroom monsters."

00:02:10.701 --> 00:02:11.801
"It could be worse.

00:02:11.801 --> 00:02:14.133
They could have
turned into drag queens."

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:16.334
"Hey. Hey, Ron.

00:02:16.334 --> 00:02:18.601
Could you shut
the [bleep] up?"

00:02:18.601 --> 00:02:20.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:20.067 --> 00:02:23.100
Also, you think the left -- you
think the left has a mind virus?

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:24.567
Let me ask.
Let me ask you.

00:02:24.567 --> 00:02:26.734
Which of these sounds
more like a mind virus to you?

00:02:26.734 --> 00:02:28.701
The side that wants
to teach accurate history,

00:02:28.701 --> 00:02:30.734
provide gender affirming
care to children,

00:02:30.734 --> 00:02:32.133
protect people
from gun violence

00:02:32.133 --> 00:02:33.567
and safeguard
reproductive rights,

00:02:33.567 --> 00:02:36.801
or the side that winds about not
wanting to bang M&amp;Ms anymore,

00:02:36.801 --> 00:02:40.133
bans books for middle school
libraries and watches Fox News

00:02:40.133 --> 00:02:43.033
all day getting angry about
gas stoves and LEGO sets?

00:02:43.033 --> 00:02:44.734
-LEGO is going woke.

00:02:44.734 --> 00:02:47.100
The company unveiling
a range of new characters

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.400
in the effort
to be more inclusive.

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:52.033
LEGO says the new characters
will promote diversity

00:02:52.033 --> 00:02:53.434
and understanding.

00:02:53.434 --> 00:02:56.200
-Dear God, a children's toy

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.100
promoting diversity
and understanding

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:03.901
What's next? Dogs that work
as a team to rescue people.

00:03:03.901 --> 00:03:07.434
Also, the only problem anyone
should ever have with LEGO

00:03:07.434 --> 00:03:10.968
is how mad they get when you say
the plural of LEGO is LEGOs,

00:03:10.968 --> 00:03:13.234
a mistake
I have made multiple times.

00:03:13.234 --> 00:03:15.033
Let me tell you,
those people are maniacs.

00:03:15.033 --> 00:03:16.133
They get so mad.

00:03:16.133 --> 00:03:17.167
Last time I said it wrong,

00:03:17.167 --> 00:03:18.501
I woke up to find a LEGO

00:03:18.501 --> 00:03:20.000
horse head in my bed.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:23.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.767 --> 00:03:25.133
That wasn't the bad bar.

00:03:25.133 --> 00:03:26.767
Then it fell on the floor,
and I [bleep] stepped on it.

00:03:26.767 --> 00:03:28.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.968 --> 00:03:31.200
The point is DeSantis knows
that the modern GOP

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.701
doesn't actually care about
using government to help people.

00:03:33.701 --> 00:03:35.234
It only cares about
the culture wars,

00:03:35.234 --> 00:03:37.133
so he's weaponizing government

00:03:37.133 --> 00:03:39.234
to use it as a tool
in those culture wars.

00:03:39.234 --> 00:03:41.834
He's been engaged
in a spree of censorship laws

00:03:41.834 --> 00:03:43.934
that banned content
conservatives don't like

00:03:43.934 --> 00:03:45.667
all the way from
elementary school to college.

00:03:45.667 --> 00:03:47.601
And now Republicans
in the Florida State Legislature

00:03:47.601 --> 00:03:50.667
have introduced a bill
that would require bloggers

00:03:50.667 --> 00:03:52.200
who write about Governor
Ron DeSantis,

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.067
his cabinet
or state legislatures

00:03:54.067 --> 00:03:55.968
to register
with the state.

00:03:55.968 --> 00:03:58.901
So now they're going
after bloggers. Why?

00:03:58.901 --> 00:04:01.767
Did DeSantis get mad
when fashion bloggers

00:04:01.767 --> 00:04:04.200
made fun of the photo of him
in his fancy white boots?

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:06.234
[ Laughter ]

00:04:06.234 --> 00:04:07.267
That's a real picture.

00:04:07.267 --> 00:04:09.501
For some reason,

00:04:09.501 --> 00:04:13.868
DeSantis decided to try out
some '60s go-go boots.

00:04:13.868 --> 00:04:15.634
Looks like an
"Austin Powers" fembot.

00:04:15.634 --> 00:04:21.100
By the way, bloggers sound like
what those boots are called.

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:22.434
"I'm going to put
on my bloggers

00:04:22.434 --> 00:04:26.701
and see if I can spear
a few swamp clams."

00:04:26.701 --> 00:04:27.701
Maybe it's not the boots.

00:04:27.701 --> 00:04:28.868
Maybe the Santos is just mad

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:30.167
because bloggers are writing

00:04:30.167 --> 00:04:32.067
about all the different
nicknames Donald Trump

00:04:32.067 --> 00:04:33.267
has been workshopping
for him.

00:04:33.267 --> 00:04:35.300
Right now,
Trump seems to be sticking

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:38.200
with Ron DeSanctimonious,
which hasn't exactly

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.200
lit the world on fire,

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:41.501
but his allies have said
in private

00:04:41.501 --> 00:04:43.167
that he's been tinkering
with some alternatives.

00:04:43.167 --> 00:04:44.968
You may have already heard
that sometimes

00:04:44.968 --> 00:04:47.901
Trump reportedly refers to him
in private as Meatball Ron,

00:04:47.901 --> 00:04:51.501
which personally, I think is
the best option so far.

00:04:51.501 --> 00:04:54.567
I mean, why keep digging
when you strike gold?

00:04:54.567 --> 00:04:57.334
I can't believe I'm saying
this to Donald Trump,

00:04:57.334 --> 00:05:00.634
of all people,
but don't overthink it.

00:05:00.634 --> 00:05:03.434
Meatball Ron sounds
like a villain on "VeggieTales"

00:05:03.434 --> 00:05:06.734
or a Carnegie Deli sandwich
named after Ron Perlman.

00:05:06.734 --> 00:05:09.701
But Trump
is still tinkering.

00:05:09.701 --> 00:05:11.801
Apparently, he's mulling
some other options.

00:05:11.801 --> 00:05:14.300
Some of the new ideas that
former president entertained --

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:16.767
Ron DisHonest,
Ron DeEstablishment,

00:05:16.767 --> 00:05:17.901
or even Tiny D.

00:05:17.901 --> 00:05:22.033
Well, Ron DisHonest
and Ron DeEstablishment,

00:05:22.033 --> 00:05:26.200
thanks for playing, but I think
we have our [bleep] winner.

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.133
Tiny -- Tiny D.

00:05:28.133 --> 00:05:30.367
The first time Trump calls him
that to his face,

00:05:30.367 --> 00:05:32.701
DeSantis is going
to spontaneously combust

00:05:32.701 --> 00:05:37.000
and leave nothing behind
but a pair of empty white boots.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:40.234
Tiny, Tiny D.

00:05:40.234 --> 00:05:41.767
I bet when Trump
finally comes up

00:05:41.767 --> 00:05:43.200
with the right nickname
for someone,

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:45.434
white smoke comes out
of the Mar-a-Lago chimney,

00:05:45.434 --> 00:05:47.667
like when they elect a new pope.

00:05:47.667 --> 00:05:48.767
[ Italian accent ]
"He's a done it.

00:05:48.767 --> 00:05:50.934
Donald he's come up
with a nickname

00:05:50.934 --> 00:05:56.334
Let's celebrate
by eating a meatball Ron."

00:05:56.334 --> 00:05:58.033
[ Normal voice ] How can you
argue with Tiny D?

00:05:58.033 --> 00:05:59.801
It sounds like
something DeSantis

00:05:59.801 --> 00:06:01.567
should have on a gold chain
around his neck

00:06:01.567 --> 00:06:03.968
like a failed --
failed --

00:06:03.968 --> 00:06:07.634
He can call his debut album,
"Woke Mind Virus."

00:06:07.634 --> 00:06:09.801
Now, as we mentioned earlier,
DeSantis is the name

00:06:09.801 --> 00:06:11.767
looming over conservative
politics right now,

00:06:11.767 --> 00:06:14.200
which is why it was notable
that he skipped

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:15.901
the Conservative Political
Action Conference.

00:06:15.901 --> 00:06:19.033
In return, Trump took
a thinly veiled shot at DeSantis

00:06:19.033 --> 00:06:20.701
on his fake Twitter site,
writing that...

00:06:34.767 --> 00:06:39.200
Now a charitable interpretation
for expand the room and space

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:40.868
is Trump means
they might need a bigger room

00:06:40.868 --> 00:06:42.200
or a second room for overfill.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:44.801
But again, this is a man
who tried to buy Greenland,

00:06:44.801 --> 00:06:46.767
so he might very well think

00:06:46.767 --> 00:06:48.767
they were literally
considering construction

00:06:48.767 --> 00:06:51.234
to make the room bigger somehow?

00:06:51.234 --> 00:06:52.701
"Just push the walls out."

00:06:52.701 --> 00:06:55.267
"Yeah, we can't do that, sir,
because the -- there are rooms

00:06:55.267 --> 00:06:56.300
on the other side
of the walls."

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:57.767
"Won't matter,
just keep pushing."

00:06:57.767 --> 00:07:01.167
"If we -- if we do that,
the other rooms will be

00:07:01.167 --> 00:07:02.467
too small to fit anything."

00:07:02.467 --> 00:07:05.200
"I know something that can fit
in a little room.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:07.968
Tiny D.

00:07:07.968 --> 00:07:12.133
Oh, is someone --
is someone cooking meatballs?"

00:07:12.133 --> 00:07:15.334
[ Laughter ]

00:07:15.334 --> 00:07:16.868
Maybe Trump's crowd was bigger,

00:07:16.868 --> 00:07:19.267
but sadly you couldn't say that
for every CPAC speaker,

00:07:19.267 --> 00:07:22.133
many of whom spoke to
embarrassingly small audiences,

00:07:22.133 --> 00:07:24.667
even including supposedly
big GOP names like Nikki Haley,

00:07:24.667 --> 00:07:26.400
Don Jr. and Kimberly Guilfoyle.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:29.033
-I'm running for president
to renew an America

00:07:29.033 --> 00:07:32.767
that's strong and proud,
not weak and woke.

00:07:32.767 --> 00:07:34.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:40.300
-All of us in this room
have one message to Joe Biden.

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:44.334
It is time to put
America first.

00:07:44.334 --> 00:07:47.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:47.234 --> 00:07:49.801
-Is it unreasonable
for me to expect,

00:07:49.801 --> 00:07:52.033
as a citizen of
the United States of America,

00:07:52.033 --> 00:07:54.300
to have a United States
senator?

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:56.133
-Well, that looks less
like an audience

00:07:56.133 --> 00:07:58.234
and more like the tour group
at a spoon museum

00:07:58.234 --> 00:08:00.467
on a Tuesday morning.

00:08:00.467 --> 00:08:02.868
I've seen middle school dance
recitals with a bigger audience.

00:08:02.868 --> 00:08:04.734
He looks like he's doing
an off-Broadway one man

00:08:04.734 --> 00:08:06.501
show called
"The Real Cocaine Bear."

00:08:06.501 --> 00:08:08.501
[ Laughter ]

00:08:10.667 --> 00:08:13.100
"Hey, could somebody tell C-SPAN
to stop cutting

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:14.868
to the [bleep] audience?"

00:08:14.868 --> 00:08:17.000
[ Laughter ]

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:24.033
The point is, CPAC was a window
into the unhinged nature

00:08:24.033 --> 00:08:25.601
of the modern
conservative worldview.

00:08:25.601 --> 00:08:27.133
They're all in
a little echo chamber,

00:08:27.133 --> 00:08:30.133
screaming half empty conference
rooms about made up [bleep]

00:08:30.133 --> 00:08:31.601
most normal people
don't care about.

00:08:31.601 --> 00:08:33.067
In fact, to show you
how disconnected they are

00:08:33.067 --> 00:08:34.467
from the average American voter,

00:08:34.467 --> 00:08:37.701
they actually invited
the pillow guy, Mike Lindell,

00:08:37.701 --> 00:08:40.734
to speak on stage
about his repeatedly

00:08:40.734 --> 00:08:42.033
