00:08:42.033 --> 00:08:43.434
-Thank you, everybody.

00:08:43.434 --> 00:08:45.033
What do you think
I'm going to talk about?

00:08:45.033 --> 00:08:46.934
[ Laughter ]

00:08:46.934 --> 00:08:48.868
We need to melt down
the machines

00:08:48.868 --> 00:08:51.934
and turn them into prison bars.

00:08:51.934 --> 00:08:53.834
I got teams of people
in every state.

00:08:53.834 --> 00:08:55.701
In fact, I'm going to announce
in a minute

00:08:55.701 --> 00:08:56.868
this new thing I have.

00:08:56.868 --> 00:08:59.300
It's called
the Election Crime Bureau.

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:01.334
We don't want to use
these machines.

00:09:01.334 --> 00:09:03.267
We want paper ballots,
hand counted.

00:09:03.267 --> 00:09:05.968
I've talked to Germany
and France and the UK

00:09:05.968 --> 00:09:08.834
and Netherlands where they use
hand-counted paper ballots.

00:09:08.834 --> 00:09:10.234
-Germany, France, UK.
Alright.

00:09:10.234 --> 00:09:11.267
I think I know
what happened here.

00:09:11.267 --> 00:09:12.734
Some teenagers have been
prank calling

00:09:12.734 --> 00:09:15.667
Mike Lindell pretending
to be different countries.

00:09:15.667 --> 00:09:18.133
[ French accent ]
"Hello, this is France.

00:09:18.133 --> 00:09:20.234
[ Laughter ]

00:09:20.234 --> 00:09:22.300
We are try find
the owner of the pillow,

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:23.801
Mike Lindell."

00:09:23.801 --> 00:09:25.767
"Thank you so much
for reaching out!

00:09:25.767 --> 00:09:27.267
I have a ton of questions!

00:09:27.267 --> 00:09:30.300
First of all, how do you say
election in French?!"

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:31.767
"Election."
"Oh, good.

00:09:31.767 --> 00:09:33.934
So French
is the same as English!"

00:09:33.934 --> 00:09:36.400
[ Laughter ]

00:09:38.901 --> 00:09:40.400
And then, of course,
there was Donald Trump

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:42.434
who did his usual shtick,
rambling incoherently,

00:09:42.434 --> 00:09:44.601
like when he talked about
the hypothetical scenario

00:09:44.601 --> 00:09:47.167
of Russia bombing NATO
or something.

00:09:47.167 --> 00:09:49.868
-NATO wouldn't even exist
if I didn't get them to pay up,

00:09:49.868 --> 00:09:53.200
but they paid up $449 billion
or something.

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:56.033
And that's the money they use.
They're rich as hell right now.

00:09:56.033 --> 00:10:00.367
They spent an office building
that cost $3 million.

00:10:00.367 --> 00:10:04.367
It's like a skyscraper
in Manhattan laid on its side.

00:10:04.367 --> 00:10:07.367
It's one of the longest
buildings I've ever seen.

00:10:07.367 --> 00:10:11.267
And I said, you should have,
instead of spending $3 billion,

00:10:11.267 --> 00:10:14.667
you should have spent
$500 million

00:10:14.667 --> 00:10:17.501
